// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO5/19/27 (LoRa SPI bus), GPIO17/18/23
// (LoRa CS/RST/IRQ), GPIO16 (external antenna switch) - see vendor
// pins_arduino.h.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard WS2812
// heartbeat RGB LED (Pycom pycom-micropython-sigfox firmware source,
// esp32/boards/LOPY/mpconfigboard.h: MICROPY_HW_HB_PIN_NUM (0); also
// vendor pins_arduino.h "RGB LED ->2812 RGB!!!"). No onboard user
// button confirmed - LoPy datasheet (docs.pycom.io) only mentions an
// "RGB LED / reset button" pairing, no separate user button.
{
  "boardName": "ESP32",
